  "The Fence said no to this plan.\n\n{reasons}\n\n**Next:** ask for less, or change the rule in your Fence.": "El Fence dijo que no a este plan.\n\n{reasons}\n\n**Siguiente:** pide menos o cambia la regla en tu Fence.",
  "The Fence said no.": "El Fence dijo que no.",
  "The Fence said no.\n\n{value}\n\n**Next:** ask for less, or change the rule in your Fence.": "El Fence dijo que no.\n\n{value}\n\n**Siguiente:** pide menos o cambia la regla en tu Fence.",
  "The Fence said no: {value}": "El Fence dijo que no: {value}",
  "The Fence's venue list and the router's choice. On chain only the call rules exist, which are derived from these venues.": "La lista de plataformas del Fence y la elección del router. En cadena solo existen las reglas de llamada, derivadas de esas plataformas.",
  "The Fold": "The Fold",
  "The Fold shows {length, plural, one {# tab} other {# tabs}} and {length2, plural, one {# bar card} other {# bar cards}}, in your order.": "El Fold muestra {length, plural, one {# pestaña} other {# pestañas}} y {length2, plural, one {# tarjeta de barra} other {# tarjetas de barra}}, en tu orden.",
  "The Forge": "The Forge",
  "The USDC arrives, but moving it on {name} costs {nativeSymbol} there, and {address} holds none. Lykia's routes don't carry gas yet: send a little {nativeSymbol} to it on {name} first.": "El USDC llega, pero moverlo en {name} cuesta {nativeSymbol} allí y {address} no tiene. Las rutas de Lykia aún no llevan gas: envíale primero un poco de {nativeSymbol} en {name}.",
  "The Whistle is blown: nothing new may start. Money coming home still passes.": "Se ha tocado el Whistle: no puede empezar nada nuevo. El dinero que vuelve a casa sigue pasando.",
