  "You asked to always keep ${cashFloorUsd} of USDC at hand. After this plan ${value} would be left.": "Pediste tener siempre ${cashFloorUsd} de USDC a mano. Después de este plan quedarían ${value}.",
  "You borrowed {value}% of what backs the loan{value2}.": "Pediste prestado el {value} % de lo que respalda el préstamo{value2}.",
